# clang-tidy config for tvm802-vision.
#
# Enforced in CI (the `lint` job, on the Windows-free TUs: src/detect_*.cpp +
# src/settings.cpp) and by tools/check.sh, which also tidies the OpenCV-free
# Windows TUs (capture/controller/settings_ui) against the i686 mingw target
# (the stock Linux clang-tidy can't parse <windows.h>); the MSVC /W4 /WX build
# covers passthrough/preview/dllmain.
#
# Check set = "everything" minus two groups of exclusions:
#   1. Project-irrelevant or style-only checks (the constixel baseline:
#      github.com/tinic/constixel/.clang-tidy) -- magic numbers, identifier
#      length, trailing return types, etc. that don't fit dense CV/UI code.
#   2. Checks inapplicable to a Win32/OpenCV drop-in DLL (would be permanent
#      noise): include-cleaner fights the <windows.h>/OpenCV umbrella headers;
#      reinterpret_cast / int-to-ptr are mandatory for HMENU / sockets / IplImage;
#      non-const globals mirror the vendor DLL's shared-state ABI by design;
#      use-anonymous-namespace -- file-`static` internal-linkage helpers are
#      interleaved with the public exports, so a per-function anonymous namespace
#      would add noise without benefit (the `static` idiom is clear and standard).
# Braces ARE required (readability-braces-around-statements stays on): brace-less
# bodies are merge-error-prone. .clang-format expands them to full blocks.
Checks: >
  *,
  -altera-*,
  -fuchsia-*,
  -llvm*,
  -hicpp-uppercase-literal-suffix,
  -hicpp-signed-bitwise,
  -misc-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -readability-uppercase-literal-suffix,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -readability-simplify-boolean-expr,
  -readability-math-missing-parentheses,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-constant-array-index,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -modernize-use-std-numbers,
  -performance-enum-size,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr,
  -android-cloexec-socket
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src/(vision|overlay|iplframe)\.h$'
FormatStyle: file
